# Committed per experiment: its scripts (to reproduce it), its README (the
# findings) and each run's summary.md (the measured tables, with the
# machine at the top). Everything else a run writes stays on the machine
# that ran it: asm, perf output, criterion's data, logs, the per-run CSV
# and machine file (sweep/README.md, "Output").
*/results/*/*
!*/results/*/summary.md
*.s
__pycache__/
.work/
